  "title": "536 CE was “the worst year in human history”, coined not only by hist...",
  "description": "536 CE was “the worst year in human history”, coined not only by historians but also #science, according to a researcher of Medieval and Early Modern Studies from @auscatholicuni . The following years saw volcano eruptions, plague, famine, and a “volcanic winter” which ended in global cooling that lasted for more than a century.   There are very few written sources available so with the help of scientific technology, we are now closer to understanding just how severe the climate change of year 536 was.  This is thanks to the discovery of tree-ring growth patterns that showed a cluster of volcanic eruptions in 536 and a few years after, and to an “ultraprecise” analysis of ice from a glacier. #history #climatechange #medieval",
